her streaming or manually triggered, depending on the configuration). ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STOPACQUISITION</Text><Enum>7</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is stopping the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_RESETTINGFEATURES</Text><Enum>8</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is resetting the features on the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_TRIGGERING</Text><Enum>9</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is processing a softwaretrigger. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_CLOSING</Text><Enum>10</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is closing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>Namespace</Name><Value>Tc3_Vision</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="CoreVision">I_ImageSource</Name><BitSize>64</BitSize><ExtendsType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000018}">PVOID</ExtendsType><Method><Name>__getState</Name><ReturnType Namespace="CoreVision.Tc3_Vision">ETcVnCameraState</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>GetCurrentImage</Name><ReturnType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Image</Name><Type GUID="{70D42C6D-6F4E-4719-8B29-2883D5D59B1C}" ReferenceTo="true">ITcVnImage</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>Reset</Name><ReturnType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>StartAcquisition</Name><ReturnType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>StopAcquisition</Name><ReturnType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>TriggerIma